  "description": "Tinyfox 是一款跨平台的高性能WebApi、标签化动态HTML服务引擎和框架。支持 Windows 和 Linux 操作系统，可运行于 .NET Framework、Mono 以及 .NET6以上.NET环境，也可以通过AOT方式生成本地程序独立运行。\nTinyfox is a cross-platform, high-performance WebApi, taggated dynamic HTML server engine and framework. Supports Windows and Linux operating systems, and runs on .NET Framework, Mono, and . In .NET environments above .NET 6, local programs can also be generated through AOT to run independently.",
